"help.speaker.title" = "Use this device as a speaker";
"help.speaker.body" = "Keep this device and the Host (Mac / Windows) on the same Wi‑Fi. Tap Start broadcasting, then discover and connect from the Host. If discovery fails, enter the IP shown here into the Host’s manual connect field.";
"help.speaker.mac.title" = "Mac Speaker notes";
"help.speaker.mac.body" = "Do not run Chorus Host on the same Mac at the same time — both use port 17482. Mac Speaker is meant as an extra speaker controlled by a Host on another computer.";
"help.troubleshooting.title" = "Troubleshooting";
"help.troubleshooting.body" = "Allow Local Network access on both devices. For system audio, allow Microphone access for Chorus Host. If a device disappears, start broadcasting again or use its displayed IP address. Corporate Wi‑Fi often blocks device-to-device traffic (client isolation) or multicast; if both discovery and manual connect fail, turn off VPN and use a personal hotspot or home network.";
